<title>JAPAN: Honda -2qtr group results (SEC).</title>
<headline>Honda -2qtr group results (SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.25 trln	 vs	    1.01 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   91.96		vs	   26.01</p>
<p> Current	     86.35		vs	   21.95</p>
<p> Net		   49.20		vs	   12.28</p>
<p> EPS		   50.49 yen	  vs	   12.61 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Honda Motor Co Ltd is a leading car and motorcycle manufacturer. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
